{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crosswords meet Battle Royale in <strong>WordCross</strong>: a fast-paced word game where strategy, speed, and chaos collide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each match, 2\u20134 players compete on a shared crossword board. Solve words to expand your board, gain points, and unlock power-ups that can disrupt your rivals. Challenge opponents to head-to-head duels, where quick thinking and clever wordplay decide who keeps control of the board. Eliminate players one by one until only one crossword champion remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WordCross</strong> is built for short, high-energy sessions full of tension, laughter, and surprises. It\u2019s easy to pick up, but every match demands focus, creativity, and just a little chaos to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>2\u20134 player matches</strong> \u2014 it's more fun with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Fast-paced crossword solving</strong> \u2014 think quickly under pressure to claim the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Head-to-head duels</strong> \u2014 directly challenge rivals to knock them out of the board!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>8\u00a0unique power-ups</strong> \u2014 twist the game in your favor and keep opponents on their toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>3,000+ words across multiple categories</strong> \u2014 endless replayability and variety!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Think quick. Play smart. Capture the board. Be the last one standing!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969330?t=1759120552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969330/e33507963d2cd3b70aad1c513529c97df1848422/page_bg_raw.jp